Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.02,0:00:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Nooooooooooooooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.93,0:00:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.85,0:00:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm gonna keep these for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.76,0:00:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You meanie!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.67,0:00:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You jump scare me by showing up\Nthen rip away something I love!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.28,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it, they're yours now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.90,0:00:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be hard for you, but it's\Nfor your own good, alright sis?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.04,0:00:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.96,0:00:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,She's crying like a cat that's\Nbeen locked out in the rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I can't give in this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.28,0:00:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure she'll understand eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.22,0:00:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But maybe taking all of\Nthem at once was too harsh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.78,0:00:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I should just give her back one box.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.76,0:00:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I was...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.42,0:00:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha, the removal was a success!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.54,0:00:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon as I heard Emocha was coming over,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.74,0:00:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I put the ol' thinking cap\Non and got to swallow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.68,0:00:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Lighter, lighter, where's my...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.60,0:00:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at you with the save.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.60,0:01:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Me, me, me. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.64,0:02:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I know this is random, it's just,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.74,0:02:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I've wanted to get something off my\Nchest, but it's easier if we're alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.00,0:02:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.74,0:02:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, listen, I guess you could\Ntell I've had a big crush on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.88,0:02:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a really big crush, Imoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.80,0:03:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And if we get married one day, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.38,0:03:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, um, thank you for saying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.08,0:03:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.20,0:03:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.92,0:03:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, man, don't let this get to you.\NIf I had better, here she would have.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.10,0:03:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,said yes dude you're Gonna bounce\Nback there are so many girls out there
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.74,0:03:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,man I like her she was it she was my
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.88,0:03:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,soul Man whoa whoa whoa dude unbelievable
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.42,0:03:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,imoko this imoko that shouldn't\Nseem that special to me Don't fall,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.04,0:03:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,don't fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.26,0:04:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.30,0:04:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you watch where you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.48,0:04:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.39,0:04:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, are you blind or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.98,0:04:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough, Mikoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.88,0:04:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really need to\Ntalk to her that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.40,0:04:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But I was just...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.92,0:04:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Imoko, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.20,0:04:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.68,0:04:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, I'll help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.10,0:04:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.46,0:04:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about Mikoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.96,0:04:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.87,0:04:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Solve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.94,0:04:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.36,0:04:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Even I know that I'm being a awful person.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.10,0:04:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.84,0:04:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just not sure how\Nelse I'm supposed to act,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.92,0:04:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,but I feel like my head's\Nprobably messed up all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.82,0:04:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here for you, and I know\Nyou'll get through this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.92,0:04:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,How about some Yonadas before we go home?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.02,0:04:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, but you're buying.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.32,0:04:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're buying, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.34,0:04:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, so why did you turn\Nhim down? He's a pretty
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.94,0:05:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,nice guy and you said\Nhe's cute he's hot right
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.20,0:05:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You could have at least given\Nhim a chance don't you think
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.60,0:05:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to say this.\NIt's just that I feel like
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.70,0:05:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He's too well put together.\NDoes that make sense?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.84,0:05:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Kinda.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.20,0:05:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you hit them again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.46,0:05:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't keep these ones either.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.82,0:05:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They've got to be right\Nthere like three cigarettes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.80,0:05:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.71,0:05:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.52,0:05:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You do realize that you would\Nnever last on your own, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.34,0:05:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Shadesmoker Cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.86,0:05:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.92,0:05:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I take care of my health\Ninsurance premium? Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.34,0:05:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And one...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.88,0:05:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,number 12. Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.74,0:05:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So what did you order?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.42,0:05:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,A Chikawa cheeseburger and a Nyamu shake.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.90,0:06:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Boss, for the half off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.56,0:06:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a Chikawa cheeseburger\Nand a Nyamu shake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.16,0:06:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Order number 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.07,0:06:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my order.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.99,0:06:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.02,0:06:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.72,0:06:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I was embarrassed,\NI'm sure you were too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.20,0:06:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.14,0:06:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I've gotten used to being\Nembarrassed by you, Yaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.94,0:06:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, thanks, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.10,0:06:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Thing is, I was called\Nby a number for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.78,0:06:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Anytime I hear that\Nnumber, I can't help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.04,0:06:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I just react.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.38,0:06:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Four times three is 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.42,0:06:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Then another 12. Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.16,0:06:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Math class must have really\Nsucked for you, huh? Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.08,0:06:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Elementary school was actually okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.68,0:06:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It happened when I was\Na bit older. Oh, gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.44,0:06:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, a teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.08,0:06:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I like the sound of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.96,0:06:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I forgot that Beast\NFolk can't become teachers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.98,0:06:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess part-timer it is, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.20,0:06:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be a lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.74,0:07:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You think Beast Folk can be lawyers?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.78,0:07:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Try again, part-timer for you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.34,0:07:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I'm gonna be a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.72,0:07:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Muddy, here I come.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.88,0:07:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctors are off limits, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.80,0:07:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell's a Beast Folk supposed\Nto make a living in this world?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.46,0:07:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This game sure is vintage, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.36,0:07:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all part-timers\Nwhether we like it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.34,0:07:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The Beast Folk Life\Ngame is fun because it's
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.60,0:07:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,completely different from the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.10,0:07:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, guess I'm a scholar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.92,0:07:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanna bet we can't be that either?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.76,0:07:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a good guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.96,0:07:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, except I chose to be a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.92,0:07:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So now you've got a\Nproblem being a Beast Folk?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.14,0:07:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.18,0:07:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,does it really even matter\Nthis is just a game?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.62,0:07:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,A game that I'm kicking your asses at.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.60,0:07:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The smart move is to cough up the\Ncash and move to Machida right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.54,0:07:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You're up to your neck and dip now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.50,0:07:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,When you reach the goal,\Nyour debt goes away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.76,0:07:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So the more in the hole\Nyou are, the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.10,0:07:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't that be nice?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.34,0:07:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, it's time to get married!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.56,0:07:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonder what my partner's species is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.90,0:07:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like a bespoke marriage for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.22,0:08:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,After you're married, you find\Nout what species they are?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.68,0:08:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that seems silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.48,0:08:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm walking down the aisle with a\Nhuman, so it looks like, yay, money!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.86,0:08:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like true love.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.56,0:08:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm marrying a human, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.88,0:08:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm marrying a beast folk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.60,0:08:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, let's see what happens when\Na human marries a beast folk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.54,0:08:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, Yaku, read it. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.88,0:08:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.64,0:08:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're a human in this game,\Nstay away from beast folk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.80,0:08:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There are many differences\Ncompared to humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.38,0:08:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.29,0:08:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Many times,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.21,0:08:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,beast folk are physically superior to\Nhumans in speed, agility, and hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.10,0:08:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Beast folk excel in underwater mobility,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.58,0:08:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,and when damp, their scent\Ncan be highly addictive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.46,0:08:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,As beast folk age, they retain\Na very youthful appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.52,0:08:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,They meow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.43,0:08:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,They can trigger cat allergies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.98,0:08:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And if either of the parents is a beast\Nfolk, the child will always be one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.60,0:08:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's definitely an old game.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.66,0:08:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Or a horror movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.22,0:08:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Next turn, that bullseye is mine. Already?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.98,0:08:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.80,0:09:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, friendly reminder the main\Ngoal in this game is to die not live.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.16,0:09:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a little creepy The\Npoint is you want to die
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.06,0:09:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,happy So basically one full\Nround is equal to one year.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.72,0:09:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That means Yani died when\Nshe was 11 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.54,0:09:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna give that smoking a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.06,0:09:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, it's my turn
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.62,0:09:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I spent a 12
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.68,0:09:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Chainsmoker!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.26,0:09:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.17,0:09:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.46,0:09:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Out to catch beetles again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.66,0:09:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Not weird at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.76,0:09:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You're like a little kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.34,0:09:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm loving your buck-catching uniform!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.16,0:09:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.68,0:09:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,On my stream,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.96,0:10:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell a story about\Na 20-year-old jobless
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.76,0:10:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,beesfolk looking for\Nbeetles instead of a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.54,0:10:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll come with you and...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.58,0:10:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaku?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.02,0:10:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You're looking for beetles?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.96,0:10:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I don't got a minute to spare.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.74,0:10:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.68,0:10:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I just don't feel like going.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.58,0:10:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, hon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.88,0:10:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.58,0:10:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Yaniko...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.49,0:10:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, she was starting a part-time job.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.68,0:10:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And then I'm pretty sure Tatsuro\Nhad some impossible work deadline.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.18,0:10:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Mariko's been drinking all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.30,0:10:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's not safe for a young\Nlady to go into the woods alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.62,0:10:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,so be careful out there, you hear? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.44,0:10:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,She got fired from a\Npart-time job, didn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.66,0:10:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess she's still upset about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.32,0:10:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.96,0:10:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I would have gone, but there's\Na neighborhood meeting today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.62,0:10:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You gonna be okay on\Nyour own? I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.28,0:10:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I have my cell phone with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.56,0:11:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you're a pretty tough kid, Yaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.26,0:11:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Just watch yourself, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.48,0:11:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaku, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.92,0:11:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If you really can't find anything,\Nthen just let me know, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.58,0:11:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.48,0:11:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This is just a little\Nunexpected vacation is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.48,0:11:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for worrying about me, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.00,0:11:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.50,0:11:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.41,0:11:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, hey, Yaniko Neko. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.52,0:11:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up, Yaku?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.28,0:11:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Thought you had a part-time gig.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.14,0:11:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,More like part-time crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.22,0:11:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They said smoking was\Nallowed during the interview,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.34,0:11:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,but when the smoking\Narea is under renovation,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.48,0:11:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,suddenly smoking is a no-no.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.36,0:11:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So I bounced.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.26,0:11:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to work\Nright now or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.34,0:11:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.06,0:11:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to catch some beetles.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.48,0:12:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm free, so how about I come with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.28,0:12:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.22,0:12:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So, do beetles taste good or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.04,0:12:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.95,0:12:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I don't eat them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.87,0:12:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean you're collecting\Nthem just for fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.12,0:12:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm looking for stag beetles,\Nand they're actually pretty cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.06,0:12:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If you say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.52,0:12:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello to my Hame channel, subscribers!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.12,0:12:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Today I have a fun surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.98,0:12:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here in the unexplored forest where\Nthe Alpha is rumored to be living!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.06,0:12:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the Alpha?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.32,0:12:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.76,0:12:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They're the Beastfolk who\Nrule this whole region.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.88,0:12:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, do you remember that stuff\Nwe smoked that got you really high?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.74,0:12:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,These cigarettes?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.72,0:12:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The Alphas actually grow\Nthe leaves for these.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.96,0:12:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Those were really smooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.94,0:12:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.16,0:13:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Most of the ones I've run into are really\Nnice, so they'll give you some if you ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.34,0:13:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.56,0:13:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Special zone number six, one\Nof the alpha tobacco villages.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.16,0:13:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.07,0:13:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like the Jomon period!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.12,0:13:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Yaku, you've returned to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.16,0:13:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And you brought a few companions I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.50,0:13:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey there, chief!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.54,0:13:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.56,0:13:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,She's The big shot who pretty much\Nruns everything around the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.02,0:13:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm Yani.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.76,0:13:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.72,0:13:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the chief here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.12,0:13:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Lani, our home welcomes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.76,0:13:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for just dropping by.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.82,0:13:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I was hoping my friends and I could\Npartake of some of your tobacco.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.96,0:13:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.14,0:13:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This year's harvest is upon us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.32,0:13:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The leaves are plentiful, so please\Nsmoke as much as you would like.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.54,0:13:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You're amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.50,0:13:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, while you're with us,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.68,0:13:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,perhaps you would like to learn about\Nour village as well as our customs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.04,0:13:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Studying and me don't get along, but\Nsmoking and I do. Help me. Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.70,0:14:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We should be respectful. Uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.80,0:14:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not worry, Yaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.58,0:14:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We start off by harvesting\Nthe grapes we grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.12,0:14:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We make wine out of the flesh\Nand all of the leaves are dried.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.74,0:14:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You must drive them in the\Nshade for three to six months.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.70,0:14:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Then remove the veins of the leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.96,0:14:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They're cut carefully into small pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.62,0:14:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,and
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.06,0:14:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,that is the
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.97,0:14:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,process of the creation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.89,0:14:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone in this village plays an\Nimportant part in making this tobacco.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.76,0:14:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Those who help grow it may smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.62,0:14:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,it as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.53,0:14:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Assisting us is key if\Nyou'd like to partake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.64,0:14:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What a stupid bull.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.06,0:14:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you try to be nice?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.74,0:14:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Your appreciation will\Ncertainly bloom if you
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.28,0:14:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,help prepare the tobacco\Nwith your own two hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.88,0:14:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, now we work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.72,0:14:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.02,0:15:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That looks horrible. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.38,0:15:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Such is the way of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.90,0:15:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, so good. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.88,0:15:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This stuff's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.40,0:15:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We have few complaints.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.18,0:15:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It is the crown jewel of the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.34,0:15:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The rich aroma does make those...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.90,0:15:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.58,0:15:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Electronic cigarettes\Nare way better than this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.42,0:15:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, lady, maybe adding\Nsome menthol would be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.46,0:15:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be easier to...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.60,0:15:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell's wrong with you, Hame?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.46,0:15:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you stink around\Nthat way, you're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.72,0:15:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, not everyone has\Nthe same taste that we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.74,0:15:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It is simply not meant for her taste buds.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.94,0:15:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're way more gel than\NI figured you would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.46,0:15:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.56,0:15:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for all of this, chief. All is well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.42,0:15:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I take no offense.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.04,0:15:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Come look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.94,0:15:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That is Mianolith.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.64,0:16:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,For eons, our Alpha tribe has stood\Nwatch over the god enshrined inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.78,0:16:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought it was just a big wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.86,0:16:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,During the great conflict\Nof centuries past,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.88,0:16:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,we could hear the solemn meow of our God,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.82,0:16:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,but now we exist in silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.68,0:16:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,When we prepare the tobacco,\Nwe offer a prayer to the God.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.04,0:16:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We breathe prayer into\Neach chop of every leaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.50,0:16:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Chop means creator hear our prayers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.20,0:16:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It reminds us to give thanks\Noften not only to our God,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.86,0:16:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,but our ancestors for all of the\Npeace we have enjoyed on this planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.90,0:16:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Look our tattoos mean the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.56,0:16:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,These two designs represent the Mianolith\Nconstantly reaching toward the Sun
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.62,0:16:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Whenever our hearts lose their way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.82,0:16:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We look at these tattoos to\Nfind the right path once more
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.22,0:16:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a pee pee. The tattoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.60,0:16:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,A pee pee and a kooka!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.76,0:17:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.14,0:17:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Chainsmoker Cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.52,0:17:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Chainsmoker Cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.04,0:17:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Chainsmoker Cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.16,0:17:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Settle down, Wynn.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.46,0:17:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Tryna light this bad boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.04,0:17:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This ritual is for the\Ncriminals within our
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.46,0:17:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,village who seek redemption\Nfrom the Mianolith.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.64,0:17:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, from that edge, it is a small leap.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.82,0:17:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I've witnessed even children\Ncomplete this ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.26,0:17:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't sign up for this shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.58,0:17:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And I definitely don't trust this role!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.16,0:17:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll find the vines to be quite\Ndurable and worthy of your use.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.78,0:17:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll die if I jump and I really,\Nreally don't want to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.28,0:17:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The time for fear has passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.96,0:17:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.88,0:18:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if I fall from here, I'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.96,0:18:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you afraid of dying?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.18,0:18:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a saying all in our village know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.30,0:18:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Death should be kept close.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.64,0:18:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It is your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.30,0:18:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't be able to smoke if I'm dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.84,0:18:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you a generous share of our\Ntobacco if you take the jump off of...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.52,0:18:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Any one of you got a lighter?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.08,0:18:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never met one like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.94,0:18:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Can she truly be without any fear?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.18,0:18:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe this isn't actually\Nas bad as I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.30,0:18:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.21,0:18:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,these crazy villagers\Njust told me that I'd
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.04,0:18:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,be killed if I didn't\Njump off this big tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.80,0:18:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,How mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.14,0:18:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm too adorable to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.12,0:18:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, it's a village of bullies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.42,0:18:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Embrace fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.34,0:19:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I must say all of your\Njumps were quite impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.30,0:19:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,From this day forward, you\Nare part of our village.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.98,0:19:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You will always be welcome here.\NYeah, I'm sure you'll see me soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.60,0:19:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,this stuff gets a 10.0 it's like\Nthree days worth all rolled into one
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.76,0:19:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,it was Fun even with the hiccups we\Nshould go back that's a no for me huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.12,0:19:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not the?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.12,0:19:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Alpha totally loved you you even got a\Nnickname the creator of rainbows that Video
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.62,0:19:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,view is I mean we have a ton of great
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.24,0:20:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,footage by the way what\Nis alpha Mean anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.08,0:20:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What it's the first letter of\Nthe Greek alphabet okay and
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.92,0:20:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,what does It mean I guess it's\Nsomething like the first one or
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.84,0:20:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,the beginning well that's Lame\Nyou're gonna get shot with a
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.86,0:20:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,ray gun again hey guys we eat you\Nwant to get before we go home?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.26,0:20:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I want Mabaroshiya's curry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.60,0:20:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You shit your pants and you still\Nwant to eat curry right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.72,0:20:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's a lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.84,0:20:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't shit my pants!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.24,0:20:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I call dips on the curry and beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.46,0:20:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.37,0:20:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The cicada!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.42,0:20:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gaming for her!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.50,0:20:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at you go, girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.44,0:20:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a crazy reaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.20,0:20:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.96,0:21:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to wash the chopsticks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.42,0:21:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.88,0:21:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And why would you use chopsticks?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.08,0:21:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I seriously thought she was\Ngoing to eat that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.08,0:21:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Imoko!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.00,0:21:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.91,0:21:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I brought some new ones!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.96,0:21:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You did?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.44,0:21:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I got them from the cafeteria.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.28,0:21:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.98,0:21:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you mean you walked all\Nthe way over to the cafeteria?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.68,0:21:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you know, you wouldn't want to keep\Neating with your other chopsticks, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.30,0:21:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.04,0:21:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, you're purring a lot right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.84,0:21:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You going through puberty?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.58,0:21:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.66,0:21:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I was kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.00,0:21:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.34,0:22:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck? That was gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.56,0:22:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to cook it first.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.00,0:22:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That was your problem with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.64,0:22:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It was good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.74,0:22:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Tastes like shrimp.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.62,0:22:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The wind-lightened light,\Nthe light-hearted light.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.24,0:22:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The light-hearted light, just the smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.96,0:22:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just sitting in a chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.94,0:22:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm drawing a picture of a mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.98,0:22:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm bringing the light-hearted, light.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.30,0:22:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in a mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.98,0:22:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for a light-hearted light.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.89,0:22:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The light-hearted light is\Nnot set to be the next door.
